%% Deletion State Machine
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Received: request submitted
    Received --> IdentityCheck: verify user
    IdentityCheck --> Discovered: scan lineage
    Discovered --> Deleting: orchestrate
    Deleting --> Verifying: each adapter returns receipt
    Verifying --> Completed: all systems confirm 0 matches
    Verifying --> PartialFailure: some systems failed
    PartialFailure --> Deleting: retry failed systems
    Completed --> [*]
